  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Prior to release 3.2, the datastream ID on \"list datastreams\" linked through to datastream content.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Since then the link is to the \"datastream profile\" which then contains a link to datastream content - however where API-A does not require authorization this means it is no longer possible for a user to navigate to datastream content.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A link to both the profile and the content should be provided on \"list datastreams\".",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For consistency with releases prior to 3.2, ID link should be to content, with an additional \"profile\" link.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For consistency with release 3.2 onwards, ID link should be to profile (as it is), with an additional \"content\" link.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Thoughts welcomed on which is more appropriate.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
